The base UL 1741-SB listing evaluates the inverter as a grid-support utility-interactive inverter to the requirements
of Supplement SB (grid-support functions). The base listing does not, in itself, evaluate the unit against
Supplement SB Power Control System (PCS) mode; the PCS-mode evaluation under Supplement SB is a
separate, additional certification and is not held by the SM-125K-3P as listed above. The product family has not
been evaluated to UL 3141 (Power Control Systems).
