Applications in DER Program scope proceed through initial technical screening under Interconnection Studies.<br>
Facilities not passing initial screens may be evaluated under supplemental review per SRP-3 or advance to a system<br>
impact study. This standard does not restate SRP-3; the daytime minimum-load convention and other screen<br>
