(c) The following federal holidays observed within response windows relevant to the current filing period are recognized as non-business days and are not counted:<br>
(d) Where a response window straddles a federal holiday not listed above, the case handler shall exclude that holiday from the count and document the calculation in the case file.<br>
§3.5  Effect of Non-Response<br>
If the applicant fails to submit a substantive response curing the matter identified in the notice within 30 business days computed under §3.4, the application shall be deemed withdrawn as of the day following expiration of the window. The DER Program Office shall:<br>
