§3.7  Non-Substitution<br>
Issuance of a Notice of Impending Withdrawal/Cancellation is not a substitute for the customer-request path under §2, and the customer-request path under §2 is not a substitute for the deemed-withdrawal path under §3. Case handlers shall not use one mechanism to accomplish what should be effected under the other.<br>
§4  Record-Keeping Requirements<br>
§4.1  Case File Contents<br>
For every application closed under §2 or §3, the DER Program Office shall maintain a case file containing, at minimum:<br>
