| AI.012  KWH_DEL  kWh  export positive  |  DNP3 serial, slot 1 port 1, POI-R1 control NPC-38, AI 12  |  class 2 event, 5 min |
| AI.013  KWH_REC  kWh  import positive  |  DNP3 serial, slot 1 port 1, POI-R1 control NPC-38, AI 13  |  class 2 event, 5 min |
| AI.014  RTU_CAB_TEMP  degC  |  RTU internal sensor  |  class 2 event |
