Submittal SUB-E-011 Rev A, 04/02/2025, for Wintbrook Processing Rooftop (PXA-2024-0099).
Breaker
Item
Calder VB-15 vacuum circuit breaker
Rating
15 kV, 1200 A, 25 kA interrupting
Trip coil
125 V dc, operating range 70 to 140 V dc, 12 A; trip coil circuit interrupted
by the breaker''s 52a contact
Close coil
125 V dc, operating range 90 to 140 V dc, 10 A
Spring charging motor
125 V dc, 8 A, 6 s charge
Auxiliary contacts
52a and 52b to the relay and SCADA
Relay
Item
Hartwell HPR-751 DER interconnection relay
Power supply
125/250 V dc, operating range 88 to 300 V dc, 20 W
Trip output
Make 30 A for 0.2 s, carry 6 A continuous, 250 V dc; trip circuit monitoring
Settings
Issued by Alleniom Distribution Protection Engineering
Prepared: M. Iversen, Electrical Engineer, Fenmoor Electric LLC, 04/02/2025.', '<h1 id="pxa-2024-0099-wintbrook-der-breaker-and-relay-data">PXA-2024-0099 Wintbrook DER Breaker and Relay Data</h1>
