700 kW ac photovoltaic system on five parking canopies: five inverters<br>
and their disconnects, the PV switchboard, the PV monitoring system, a<br>
750 kVA step-up transformer and its 13.2 kV interconnection<br>
Adopted code<br>
NFPA 70, National Electrical Code, 2023 edition, as adopted by City<br>
Ordinance 24-118<br>
Inspection record<br>
Date<br>
Inspection<br>
Result<br>
06/03/2025<br>
Underground: Schedule 40 PVC conduit at 600 mm cover,<br>
including the auxiliary circuit to the POI pole, before backfill<br>
Approved<br>
06/09/2025<br>
Equipment pads; ground ring around the T-1 and SWBD-PV<br>
pads<br>
Approved<br>
06/16/2025<br>
Canopy rough-in: trays, conduit, column risers, combiners<br>
Approved<br>
06/23/2025<br>
Equipment set: T-1, PSW-1, SWBD-PV with its auxiliary<br>
transformer and panel, inverters and their disconnects, DAS-1<br>
Approved<br>
07/02/2025<br>
Final<br>
Approved; no<br>
corrections<br>
Disposition<br>
Final approval of the permitted work. The permitted work may be<br>
energized and operated in parallel with the utility on the utility''s<br>
permission.<br>
Issued by: Dolores Achebe, Chief Electrical Inspector, City of Wrenford Department of Inspections, 07/02/2025.</p>', '[]', 'markdown', '2026-11-19T12:07:38.055842+00:00', '2026-11-19T12:07:38.055842+00:00', 'markdown', 'en', 29, 29, '{}');
