CORWYN REALTY PARTNERS
2400 Corwyn Parkway, Wrenford, Alleron 04WR · property management office (612) 555-0827
07/10/2025
To: Commissioning, DER Program Office, Alleniom Utilities
Request for permission to operate: Corwyn Office Complex PV,
PXA-2023-0629, feeder ALN-072
Corwyn Realty Partners requests written permission to operate Corwyn Office Complex PV in parallel with
feeder ALN-072 from 08/04/2025. Construction was completed on 06/27/2025 and the utility witness test was
held on 07/08/2025. The City of Wrenford gave final approval under permit WEP-25-0317 on 07/02/2025.
Please confirm 08/04/2025, or tell us what stands in the way.
Nadia Ferreira-Holt, Director of Property Operations, Corwyn Realty Partners', '<h1 id="2025-07-10-corwyn-pto-request">2025-07-10 Corwyn PTO Request</h1>
