| Tag | Equipment | Location | Data | Mounting |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| T-1 | T-1: 750 kVA, 13.2 kV grounded wye to 480Y/277 V | Equipment yard, north lot | Pad-mounted, liquid-filled; impedance 5.75 %; secondary cable bus to SWBD-PV | Cast-in-place concrete pad |
| PSW-1 | T-1 primary switch: 15 kV, 200 A load-break, with 65E current-limiting fuses | Equipment yard | Pad-mounted, padlockable; T-1 full-load primary current 32.8 A | Cast-in-place concrete pad |
| SWBD-PV | PV switchboard: 480Y/277 V, 3-phase, 4-wire, NEMA 3R, 1,200 A bus, 1,200 A main breaker; five 225 A inverter breakers (INV-C1 to INV-C5) and a 40 A two-pole breaker for TX-1; 35 kA rated, all its breakers | Equipment yard, beside T-1 | T-1 full-load secondary current 902 A; available fault current at SWBD-PV 15.7 kA | Floor-standing on the 4 in. concrete housekeeping pad; base channels bolted to cast-in steel channel inserts |
| TX-1 | Auxiliary transformer: 15 kVA, dry-type, single-phase, 480 V to 120/240 V, NEMA 3R; fed from a 40 A two-pole breaker in SWBD-PV | Equipment yard, beside SWBD-PV | Full-load current 31.3 A primary, 62.5 A secondary; secondary 4 AWG Cu, 1.5 m in 1 in. rigid steel conduit, to the PP-1 main breaker; neutral bonded at TX-1; grounding electrode conductor 6 AWG Cu to the 2 AWG bare Cu ground ring | Galvanized steel frame on the SWBD-PV pad, 0.5 m above the pad |
| PP-1 | Auxiliary panel: 120/240 V, single-phase, 3-wire, 100 A bus, 70 A main breaker, NEMA 3R. Circuit 1: dedicated 20 A circuit to the utility RTU enclosure on the POI pole, through the 1.5 kVA online UPS in that enclosure (5.5 h at the RTU load). Circuit 2: SWBD-PV enclosure heaters, 20 A. Circuits 3 to 12: spare. | Equipment yard, beside TX-1 | Circuit 1: 2 x 12 AWG Cu and 12 AWG Cu ground in 3/4 in. Schedule 40 PVC at 600 mm cover to the POI pole, then 3/4 in. rigid steel conduit up the pole | Galvanized steel frame on the SWBD-PV pad, 0.5 m above the pad |
