| RM-0629 | Revenue meter (utility-owned), 13.2 kV primary metering | Point of interconnection | Set by Alleniom Metering | Utility pole |
| POI | POI recloser and RTU (utility-owned) | Point of interconnection | Alleniom facilities under the ISA | Utility pole |
| GND | 480Y/277 V neutral bonded at the SWBD-PV main; grounding electrode conductor 3/0 AWG bare Cu from the SWBD-PV neutral bus to the 2 AWG bare Cu ground ring around the T-1 and SWBD-PV pads; canopy steel and module frames bonded to the equipment grounding conductors | Site | Resistance to earth measured 4.2 ohm, 06/2025 | — |
