</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Trays</td>
<td>One 12 in. hot-dip galvanized steel ladder tray per canopy, 9 in. rung spacing, on the north side of the canopy main beam; tray sections bonded with bonding jumpers</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Supports</td>
<td>Tray clamps to the beam at 1.5 m centers</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Column risers</td>
<td>Rigid steel conduit, threaded, with a bonding bushing at the tray end</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>', '[]', 'markdown', '2026-11-19T12:07:38.055842+00:00', '2026-11-19T12:07:38.055842+00:00', 'markdown', 'en', 8, 8, '{}');
