on municipal service center pv cc meera vellanki meera.vellanki alleniom.com der program office attached please find the city of elmsworth der interconnection application for the municipal service center pv project form dis app 01 assigned application id pxa 2025 0198 on your intake page nameplate is 900 kw ac behind the meter with export capability mounted on the municipal service center rooftop and adjacent parking canopy for your records this filing follows our earlier application pxa 2023 0412 dated 04 12 2023 for the same municipal service center site the 2023 filing sat with our office through budget cycle change and facilities director turnover on our side and we did not push it forward during that period the scope in the current package is materially the same site the same 900 kw envelope and the same point of interconnection area on the mid town elmsworth feeder the update is the cel 2025 q2 inverter selection and refreshed drawings dated 05 16 2025 given the continuity of the project we would like to retain our original 2023 queue position council approved the capital allocation in the fy25 budget on the assumption that we would be in construction this fall and every month we slide back in the queue is month that pushes mechanical completion past the winter shutdown window and into next spring we would appreciate your team confirmation on that point at your earliest convenience so we can lock in permit and procurement dates we are targeting the following applicant side milestones also carried in section of the application permit set complete 08 2025 construction start 10 2025 mechanical completion 02 2026 ready for witness test 03 2026 if any of those dates look unworkable against your screening or study calendar please tell us now rather than later we would much rather adjust on the front end than discover slip in september am reachable at the number below any weekday and meera has my mobile if something needs faster turn thank you for the continued partnership we appreciate the der program office attention on this one it is visible project for the city and the council is watching the schedule closely best regards bill tran energy manager city of elmsworth 300 city center way elmsworth alleron 07el 612 236 0402 bill.tran cityofelmsworth.gov attachments pxa 2025 0198 elmsworth application.pdf form dis app 01 pp.');
