uting the applicable deadline from the date shown at the top of this notice required response substantive response consists of written submission addressed to interconnection studies at the address shown in the letterhead or by email to der.program alleniom.com that materially addresses the outstanding information request associated with pxa 2024 0161 the company will treat the postmark date for mailed submissions or the timestamp of receipt for electronic submissions as the date of response corvale public library district attn library director 410 carrow street corvale alleron 18cv 4200 veldmere boulevard halston alleron 01ha consequence of non response failure to submit substantive response within the period stated in §2 above shall result in application pxa 2024 0161 being deemed withdrawn and closed from the active queue without further action of the company in accordance with §12.4 subsequent der interconnection request for the same site would require submission of new application which would take its own queue position as of the date determined complete contact questions concerning the outstanding information request or the procedural effect of this notice may be directed to interconnection studies at der.program alleniom.com or 612 555 0100 signature issued by interconnection studies queue administration on behalf of meera vellanki by queue administration meera vellanki manager interconnection studies alleniom utilities meera.vellanki alleniom.com copy to file pxa 2024 0161 notices copy to withdrawal notice log icq wnl standing document control doc no rev date owner delivery certified mail usps certified article no 7015 1520 0002 4738 6194 prepared 04 17 2025 released 04 22 2025 register notices of impending withdrawal cancellation tariff §12.4');
